{
  "name": "fairclinic-boarding-grooming",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Fairclinic Boarding and Grooming: boarding, daycare and grooming reservations against invoice lines: stays with no invoice, fewer nights or days invoiced than stayed, and booked add-ons not invoiced, valued at your list prices. It never changes an invoice or charges a client. Pet and client names are masked before results reach the model.",
